    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DeltaPhysics is 2D nonlinear platformer - featuring clean, fluid physics-based platforming in a dynamic, interactive environment. Master physics-based platforming and movement upgrades, to discover new paths through an interconnected map of platforming challenges and puzzles.    <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116080/extras/4f388bec37019d82cc987c51839f3112.poster.avif?t=1753677069\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116080/extras/4f388bec37019d82cc987c51839f3112.webm?t=1753677069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116080/extras/4f388bec37019d82cc987c51839f3112.mp4?t=1753677069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Physically-simulated ability upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Nonlinear map of interconnected puzzles and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Physics-inspired level design and mechanics, including special modes of movement</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116080/extras/4282c7aed11931346b2ccb08989595eb.poster.avif?t=1753677069\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116080/extras/4282c7aed11931346b2ccb08989595eb.webm?t=1753677069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116080/extras/4282c7aed11931346b2ccb08989595eb.mp4?t=1753677069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: The game is still in development, and some footage may not accurately reflect gameplay experience.</p>",
